# Driver for tools/cov/specs/shredder_force.py (Torvus 01_swamp_entrance, layer 3): B is put in
# the pool while it lurks and is then woken; A wakes by detection and is parked 6 from the player.
@f200 layer 3
@f300 god 1; tp 154 -80 23
@f320 place u04e3 player 1
@f340 obj u04e3; obj u04e6
@f380 send u04e3 Alert
@f440 objs Shredder; obj u04e6; obj u04e3
@f480 tp 210 -90 34
@f520 place u04e6 player 6; obj u04e6
@f560 place u04e6 player 6; objs Shredder
@f640 obj u04e6; objs Shredder
